config.simplyjetpacks.controls.doubleTapSprintInAir.tooltip=When enabled, sprinting by double-tapping the forward key will work while flying with a Jetpack. Can be used as an easier way to activate a Jetpack's boost while airborne (the sprint key also works).
config.simplyjetpacks.aesthetics.enableArmor3DModels.tooltip=When enabled, worn Jetpacks and Fluxpacks will have a 3D armor model. Otherwise, flat textures will be used.
config.simplyjetpacks.sounds.jetpackSounds.tooltip=When enabled, jetpacks will make sounds when used.
