config.simplyjetpacks.gui.hudPosition.tooltip=Change the position of the HUD.
config.simplyjetpacks.gui.HUDOffsetX.tooltip=The HUD display will be shifted horizontally by this value. This value may be negative.
config.simplyjetpacks.gui.HUDOffsetY.tooltip=The HUD display will be shifted vertically by this value. This value may be negative.
config.simplyjetpacks.gui.HUDScale.tooltip=How large the HUD will be rendered.
