config.simplyjetpacks.integration.enableIntegrationMek.tooltip=When enabled, Simply Jetpacks will register its Mekanism Jetpacks.
config.simplyjetpacks.integration.enableIntegrationIE.tooltip=When enabled, Simply Jetpacks will register its Immersive Engineering Jetpacks.
config.simplyjetpacks.integration.enableIntegrationRR.tooltip=When enabled, Simply Jetpacks will register its Redstone Repository Tier5 JetPlate recipes.
config.simplyjetpacks.integration.gelidEnderiumEnergyUsageBonus.tooltip=When set to a value between 0-100, changes the energy efficiency bonus of the Enderium Armored Jetplate (Example: 80 uses energy at 80% rate).
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.energyCapacity.tooltip=The maximum amount of energy that this pack can hold.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.energyUsage.tooltip=The amount of energy that this Jetpack/Fluxpack uses every tick, when being used.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.energyPerTickIn.tooltip=The amount of energy that can be inserted into this Jetpack/Fluxpack per tick from external sources.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.energyPerTickOut.tooltip=The amount of energy that can be extracted from this Jetpack/Fluxpack per tick by external sources. Also determines how quickly Jetpacks/Fluxpacks can charge other items.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.armorReduction.tooltip=How well this Jetpack/Fluxpack can protect the user from damage, if armored. The higher the value, the stronger the armor will be.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.armorEnergyPerHit.tooltip=How much energy is lost from this Jetpack/Fluxpack when the user is hit, if armored.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.speedVertical.tooltip=The maximum vertical speed of this Jetpack when flying.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.accelVertical.tooltip=The vertical acceleration of this Jetpack when flying, every tick, this amount of vertical speed will be added until maximum speed is reached.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.speedVerticalHover.tooltip=The maximum vertical speed of this Jetpack when flying in Hover Mode.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.speedVerticalHoverSlow.tooltip=The maximum vertical speed of this Jetpack when slowly descending in Hover Mode.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.speedSideways.tooltip=The speed of this Jetpack when flying sideways. This is mostly noticeable in Hover Mode.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.sprintSpeedModifier.tooltip=How much faster this Jetpack will fly forward when sprinting. Setting this to 1.0 will make sprinting have no effect apart from the added speed from vanilla.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.sprintEnergyModifier.tooltip=How much more energy this Jetpack will use when sprinting. Setting this to 1.0 will make sprinting have no effect on energy usage.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.emergencyHoverMode.tooltip=When enabled, this Jetpack will be able to activate Hover Mode automatically when the wearer is about to die from a fall.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.chargerMode.tooltip=When enabled, this Jetpack will be able to activate Charger Mode.
config.simplyjetpacks.tuning.enchantability.tooltip=The enchantability of this Jetpack/Fluxpack. If set to 0, no enchantments can be applied.
